{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/120210_144357_ed.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』若月『きのことたらこのパスタだしね。』西野『いや、このパスタは…きのこもおるけど…たらこやで？って感じだと思ってん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』若月『どんな感じだよ("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑)』\" border=\"0\">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/120210_144258_ed.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』若月『きのことたらこのパスタだしね。』西野『いや、このパスタは…きのこもおるけど…たらこやで？って感じだと思ってん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』若月『どんな感じだよ("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑)』\" border=\"0\">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"………下らなさすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに提案者は玲香。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のキャプテンが\nこんなんでいいのか(  ；∀；)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで始まりました\n若月ブログ(゜Д゜；≡；゜Д゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんいかがお過ごしですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま、\n脱ケーキをしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脱ケーキをした末に\n入きゅうりをしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はきゅうりにはまりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後『河童みたい。』\n岩瀬『河童かよ。』\n畠中『ミュウミュウ実は河童やねん？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひどい。ひどいよ(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界中のきゅうり愛好家に\n謝れ(｀・ω・)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n父親もきゅうり好きだったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして…河童だっ((ry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだこのブログ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く…早く…早く\nファンの皆さんに会いたい。\nう゛ー・゜・(つД｀)・゜・\n握手会までが長いよ(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠すぎて\n今なら空も飛べる。\nというわけで\n今日はここまでで\nすみません（つд；*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ、まいまいが後ろにいる写メでお別れ・゜・(つД｀)・゜・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/120204_161112_ed.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}